{"reference":"Isaiah 35","book":"Isaiah","chapter":35,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Isaiah’s Textual Witnesses","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The Great Isaiah Scroll preserves almost the whole sixty-six-chapter book of Isaiah. It broadly aligns with the Masoretic tradition, though it contains many spelling and substantive differences; other Qumran Isaiah manuscripts and interpretive writings also reflect active transmission and interpretation of Isaiah’s text. The precise implications of these differences remain disputed.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_isaiah_035_970e69a08396f5ad16a65e4a"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}